//RS /// What a single dev/serve iteration produced.
//RS ///
//RS /// Identical shape to the AOT compilation result (Q2 hard rule):
//RS /// `Ran.stdout`/`Ran.stderr`/`Ran.exit_code` are byte-identical to the compiled
